# Working documents — kept on disk, kept out of the repository.
#
# These are the notes this project was built from: design exports, page
# inventories, audit passes, deployment runbooks and handoff prompts. They
# are useful to whoever is building, and noise to anyone reading the code —
# several are long, several contradict each other by design (an audit is a
# snapshot, not a statement of current truth), and one of them is a
# deployment runbook that should not be the first thing a stranger reads.
#
# README.md stays: it is the one document that is meant to be read here.
AUDIT_REPORT*.md
DEPLOY.md
DESIGN.md
DESIGN_INVENTORY.md
